    "detail": {
      "id": 1000954,
      "name": "[Affinity] Up to the Task",
      "desc": "Rina has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Dance Duet]</color>. After launching a Dash Attack or Dodge Counter, your character can <color=#2BAD00>immediately follow up with</color> certain attacks near the end of the Basic Attack combo.\nDance Duet: After being sent out to launch an attack, Drusilla and Anastella stay in place for an additional 5.5s before returning to Rina.\nThe effect gained from <color=#FFFFFF>Core Passive: Mini Destruction Partner</color> by characters within 10m is increased to 130% of the original value.",
      "desc2": "Rina and her little Bangboo are in excellent condition. Navigating through the dangerous Hollows is as easy as playing a game of tag.",
